abstract: "Browser-based simulator of the power to detect selection at a candidate locus from allele frequencies sampled at two or more points in time, with genetic drift, migration, haploid, diploid or haplodiploid inheritance, changing effective population size and low-coverage genotype calls."
keywords:
  - temporal population genomics
  - natural selection
  - statistical power
  - historical DNA
  - ancient DNA
  - museum genomics
